 248  * ELECTRICITY PLANNING MODEL (EPM)
 249  * Developed at the World Bank
 250  **********************************************************************
 251  * Description:
 252  * This GAMS-based model is designed for electricity system planning,
 253  * incorporating capacity expansion, generation dispatch, and policy
 254  * constraints such as renewable energy targets, emissions reductions,
 255  * and market mechanisms.
 256  *
 257  * Author(s): ESMAP Modelling Team
 258  * Organization: World Bank
 259  * Version:
 260  * License: Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal
 261  *
 262  * Key Features:
 263  * - Optimization of electricity generation and capacity planning
 264  * - Inclusion of renewable energy integration and storage technologies
 265  * - Multi-period, multi-region modeling framework
 266  * - CO2 emissions constraints and policy instruments
 267  *
 268  * Notes:
 269  * - Ensure GAMS is installed before running this model.
 270  * - The model requires input data in .GDX.
 271  *
 272  * Contact:
 273  * Claire Nicolas, cnicolas@worldbank.org
 274  **********************************************************************
