1075  **********************************************************************
1076  * ELECTRICITY PLANNING MODEL (EPM)
1077  * Developed at the World Bank
1078  **********************************************************************
1079  * Description:
1080  * This GAMS-based model is designed for electricity system planning,
1081  * incorporating capacity expansion, generation dispatch, and policy
1082  * constraints such as renewable energy targets, emissions reductions.
1083  *
1084  * Author(s): ESMAP Modelling Team
1085  * Organization: World Bank
1086  * Version:
1087  * License: Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal
1088  *
1089  * Key Features:
1090  * - Optimization of electricity generation and capacity planning
1091  * - Inclusion of renewable energy integration and storage technologies
1092  * - Multi-period, multi-region modeling framework
1093  * - CO2 emissions constraints and policy instruments
1094  *
1095  * Notes:
1096  * - Ensure GAMS is installed before running this model.
1097  * - The model requires input data in .GDX or Excel format.
1098  *
1099  * Contact:
1100  * Claire Nicolas, cnicolas@worldbank.org
1101  **********************************************************************
1102   
1105   
1106  *-------------------------------------------------------------------
1107  * DECLARATION OF SETS, PARAMETERS AND VARIABLES
