1190   
1191  * Additional parameters for results and reporting
1192  * -------------------------------------------------------------
1193  * Global flags and shared parameters for reporting/constraints
1194  * -------------------------------------------------------------
1195  Parameter
1196     pAllHours(q,d,y,t)           'All operating hours (used for peak tracking)'
1197     pFindSysPeak(y)              'Yearly system peak indicator'
1198     pSeasonalReporting           'Enable seasonal report outputs'
1199     fEnableInternalExchange      'Allow internal zone trading'
1200     fRemoveInternalTransferLimit 'Override internal transfer limits'
1201     fAllowTransferExpansion      'Permit expansion of internal transmission (set elsewhere too; redundant flag)'
1202  * Contracted transfer volumes, off by default (see eContractedSeasonalTransfer).
1203  * For corridors governed by a power purchase agreement, where the delivered
1204  * energy is set by contract rather than chosen by the optimiser.
1205  * 0 = off, 1 = deliver exactly the contracted volume (must-run), 2 = deliver at
1206  * least the contracted volume (take-or-pay floor). Leaving it at 0 reproduces
1207  * the model exactly as it was.
1208     fApplyContractedTrade        'Contracted transfer mode (0 = off, 1 = exact volume, 2 = minimum volume)'
1209     sContractedTradeFirstYear    'First year contracted volumes apply (0 = never)'
1210     pDR                          'Discount rate applied in objective'
1211     fEnableCapexTrajectoryH2     'Toggle CAPEX trajectory for hydrogen assets'
1212     fEnableEnergyEfficiency     'Enable demand-side efficiency adjustments'
1213     fApplySystemCo2Constraint   'Apply system-wide CO₂ constraint'
1214     pExtTransferLimitIn(z,zext,q,y)  'Exogenous import limit from external zones'
1215     pExtTransferLimitOut(z,zext,q,y) 'Exogenous export limit to external zones'
1216     psVREForecastErrorPct        'Forecast error percentage for VRE (used in reserves)'
1217  ;
1218   
1219  * Additional structure sets (technology/mapping)
1220  Set
1221     gprimf(g,f)            'Primary fuel used by each generator'
1222     gtechmap(g,tech)       'Generator-to-technology linkage'
1223     gstatusmap(g,gstatus)  'Generator status lookup (existing/candidate/committed)'
1224     tstatusmap(z,z2,tstatus) 'Transmission status lookup'
1225     Zd(z)                  'Demand-serving zones'
1226     Zt(z)                  'Zone type classification (often redundant with Zd)'
1227     stg(g)                 'Storage generators (grid-scale)'
1228     ror(g)                 'Run-of-river assets (subset of renewables)'
1229     MinGenPoint(g)         'Generators with minimum generation constraints (used for startup cost accumulation)'
1230  ;
1231   
1232   
1233  Parameters
1234     pCostOfCurtailment          'Penalty on curtailed VRE (check usage – may be redundant)'
1235     pCostOfCO2backstop          'CO₂ backstop cost ($/ton)'
1236     pWeightYear(y)              'Inter-year weighting factor'
