1264     psVREForecastErrorPct          'Reserve add-on for VRE (note: duplicate naming with parameter above)'
1265     pCarbonPrice(y)                'Carbon price trajectory'
1266     pFuelCarbonContent(f)          'Fuel carbon intensity (tCO₂/MMBtu)'
