1378  * ------------------------------
1379  * Unit-commitment binaries
1380  * Tracks each generator's ON/OFF state per dispatch slot and records every startup/shutdown transition for constraint logic.
1381  * The chronological mapping `mapTS` ensures these binaries only represent valid hours.
